# The repo root ignores `*.jsonl` because that extension is otherwise only
# ever a bulk DATA file (see the data-format block in /.gitignore). The traces
# in here are the opposite: hand-written, tiny, and load-bearing — the
# policy-replay determinism test and the pinned incumbent baseline both read
# them, so they must be committed. Scoped to this directory only.
!*.jsonl
